#
# Two 2D k-grids as families of 21 parallel lines each, 21 points per line:
#   lines  1-21 : 21x21 grid centred on K_sc  (conduction minimum, displaced)
#   lines 22-42 : 21x21 grid centred on Gamma (valence maximum)
# Each grid spans +-0.008 Bohr^-1 in two orthogonal CARTESIAN directions,
# spacing 8.0e-4 Bohr^-1.  Fitting E = E0 + a kx^2 + b ky^2 + c kx ky over each
# grid gives the full 2D mass tensor, its principal masses and axis orientation.
#

